# Next.js

- Routes: `src/app/<path>/page.tsx`
- API: `src/app/api/<name>/route.ts` — export GET/POST handlers
- Shared code: `src/lib/` — import as `@/lib/...`
- Default: Server Components. Add `"use client"` only for hooks/events/browser APIs
- Styles: Tailwind in component, globals in `src/app/globals.css`
- Metadata: `layout.tsx` or per-page `export const metadata`
- No Pages Router (`pages/`, getServerSideProps)
